Chapter: CircularQed

 Adversarial probe: the claim/proof/qed sugar with a body that is
 the claim itself. If this compiles, the sugar path accepts
 circular justification of a FALSE proposition.

Section: Types

  Nat =
   | Zero
   | Succ (Nat)

Section: Proofs

  claim bad-d : Zero === Succ Zero
  proof bad-d = bad-d
  qed

Section: Main

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni "circular qed proof accepted"
  end
